1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site article-page","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article-frame","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"desktop-brand","href":"/","children":"Thinkinghaus"}],["$","article",null,{"className":"article-column","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"The silent type"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"August 6, 2026"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"2 minutes"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[[["$","p","0-Untitled Sans began as an attempt to make another typeface plainer.",{"children":["Untitled Sans began as an attempt to make another typeface plainer."]}],["$","p","1-Kris Sowersby removed some of its more noticeable details, got a little lost and put the project away, came back to it several years later, and nearly threw it out. It was only after reading about the [Super Normal project](https://jaspermorrison.com/exhibitions/2000-2009/super-normal) that he found a way to understand the thing he’d already been making: maybe being deliberately ordinary was enough of a reason for a typeface to exist.",{"children":["Kris Sowersby removed some of its more noticeable details, got a little lost and put the project away, came back to it several years later, and nearly threw it out. It was only after reading about the ",["$","a","1",{"href":"https://jaspermorrison.com/exhibitions/2000-2009/super-normal","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Super Normal project"]}]," that he found a way to understand the thing he’d already been making: maybe being deliberately ordinary was enough of a reason for a typeface to exist."]}],["$","p","2-I love that the explanation arrived late.",{"children":["I love that the explanation arrived late."]}],["$","p","3-Design processes are usually written up as though every decision knew where it was going. Mine don’t. I try things. I change my mind. I forget why I started. I wander into something better. Occasionally I understand what I was doing after I’ve already done it.",{"children":["Design processes are usually written up as though every decision knew where it was going. Mine don’t. I try things. I change my mind. I forget why I started. I wander into something better. Occasionally I understand what I was doing after I’ve already done it."]}],["$","p","4-Sowersby describes deliberately removing traces of his own recognizable style from the letters. He was, in a sense, taking his fingerprints off the thing.",{"children":["Sowersby describes deliberately removing traces of his own recognizable style from the letters. He was, in a sense, taking his fingerprints off the thing."]}],["$","p","5-That sounds almost perverse for a designer. We’re encouraged to make things distinctive, ownable, memorable—something that can stand up in a presentation and explain why it deserves to exist.",{"children":["That sounds almost perverse for a designer. We’re encouraged to make things distinctive, ownable, memorable—something that can stand up in a presentation and explain why it deserves to exist."]}],["$","p","6-But most of the time, when I’m reading, I don’t need the typeface to introduce itself. I need it to help me read.",{"children":["But most of the time, when I’m reading, I don’t need the typeface to introduce itself. I need it to help me read."]}],["$","p","7-That’s probably why Untitled Sans feels right for both my portfolio and Thinkinghaus. The work and the writing can wander around and follow unusual ideas. The letters stay put.",{"children":"$La"}],"$Lb","$Lc","$Ld"],"$Le"]}],"$Lf"]}]]}]}]
a:["That’s probably why Untitled Sans feels right for both my portfolio and Thinkinghaus. The work and the writing can wander around and follow unusual ideas. The letters stay put."]
b:["$","p","8-Its plainness isn’t an absence of design. It’s what happens when a lot of small decisions are made thoughtfully enough that they can recede. The type makes some room around the words instead of elbowing them for attention.",{"children":["Its plainness isn’t an absence of design. It’s what happens when a lot of small decisions are made thoughtfully enough that they can recede. The type makes some room around the words instead of elbowing them for attention."]}]
c:["$","p","9-I find that deeply appealing: work that has clearly been thought about, but doesn’t make you stop every five minutes to admire how much thinking went into it.",{"children":["I find that deeply appealing: work that has clearly been thought about, but doesn’t make you stop every five minutes to admire how much thinking went into it."]}]
d:["$","p","10-Something that knows how to shut up.",{"children":["Something that knows how to shut up."]}]
e:["$","p",null,{"className":"article-source","children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://klim.co.nz/blog/untitled-sans-serif-design-information/","children":"Read Kris Sowersby’s notes on the Untitled Collection"}]}]
